Package: mdview
Version: 1.4.1
Section: text
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, python3-markdown, python3-pygments, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-webkit2-4.1 | gir1.2-webkit2-4.0
Maintainer: <classacc7272@gmail.com>
Description: Minimal Markdown-only viewer
 Opens .md files with GitHub-style rendering and heading anchors,
 light/dark themes, a live-preview editor with find and replace, auto-reload, and Markdown file association.
